msgid "MonServiceSécurisé (ANSSI): the 135 measures of the security accreditation service, grouped by theme, their references on the controls and MonServiceSécurisé score. Disabled by default."
msgstr "MonServiceSécurisé (ANSSI): the 135 measures of the security accreditation service, grouped by theme, their references on the controls and MonServiceSécurisé score. Disabled by default."

msgid "Trust service providers (ETSI EN 319 401): general policy requirements, their references on the controls and ETSI score. Disabled by default."
msgstr "Trust service providers (ETSI EN 319 401): general policy requirements, their references on the controls and ETSI score. Disabled by default."

msgid "Secure Controls Framework: the 34 SCF domains, their references on the controls and SCF score. Disabled by default."
msgstr "Secure Controls Framework: the 34 SCF domains, their references on the controls and SCF score. Disabled by default."

msgid "Measures: %s"
msgstr "Measures: %s"

msgid "MonServiceSécurisé (ANSSI): security accreditation measures"
msgstr "MonServiceSécurisé (ANSSI): security accreditation measures"

msgid "The %d measures of the measures framework of MonServiceSécurisé, the free service of the French cybersecurity agency to accredit a digital service, grouped by theme within its four categories. The last column links to the modules of this plugin that already help meet them."
msgstr "The %d measures of the measures framework of MonServiceSécurisé, the free service of the French cybersecurity agency to accredit a digital service, grouped by theme within its four categories. The last column links to the modules of this plugin that already help meet them."

msgid "Source: measures framework (version 2) published by ANSSI in the source code of MonServiceSécurisé (github.com/betagouv/mon-service-securise) under the Apache 2.0 licence; the GDPR measures come from the CNIL. Measure identifiers are the official ones; theme summaries and the mapping to ISO 27001 Annex A are written by this project, which is not affiliated with ANSSI."
msgstr "Source: measures framework (version 2) published by ANSSI in the source code of MonServiceSécurisé (github.com/betagouv/mon-service-securise) under the Apache 2.0 licence; the GDPR measures come from the CNIL. Measure identifiers are the official ones; theme summaries and the mapping to ISO 27001 Annex A are written by this project, which is not affiliated with ANSSI."

msgid "ETSI EN 319 401 V3.2.1: general policy requirements for trust service providers"
msgstr "ETSI EN 319 401 V3.2.1: general policy requirements for trust service providers"

msgid "Common base of the ETSI standards audited for qualified trust services under eIDAS (signature, seal, time-stamping, certificates). Clauses 5 to 7, summarised by this project. The last column links to the modules of this plugin that already help meet them."
msgstr "Common base of the ETSI standards audited for qualified trust services under eIDAS (signature, seal, time-stamping, certificates). Clauses 5 to 7, summarised by this project. The last column links to the modules of this plugin that already help meet them."

msgid "ETSI EN 319 401 is protected by copyright (ETSI, all rights reserved): only its clause numbers are used here; summaries and the mapping to ISO 27001 Annex A are written by this project, which is not affiliated with ETSI. The standard can be downloaded free of charge from etsi.org."
msgstr "ETSI EN 319 401 is protected by copyright (ETSI, all rights reserved): only its clause numbers are used here; summaries and the mapping to ISO 27001 Annex A are written by this project, which is not affiliated with ETSI. The standard can be downloaded free of charge from etsi.org."

msgid "Secure Controls Framework (SCF): domains"
msgstr "Secure Controls Framework (SCF): domains"

msgid "The 34 domains of the SCF metaframework, which maps more than two hundred laws, regulations and standards. Domain names are kept in English, as published. The last column links to the modules of this plugin that already help meet them."
msgstr "The 34 domains of the SCF metaframework, which maps more than two hundred laws, regulations and standards. Domain names are kept in English, as published. The last column links to the modules of this plugin that already help meet them."

msgid "Domain identifiers and names: Secure Controls Framework (SCF), © SCF Council, licensed under CC BY-ND 4.0, reproduced without modification. The mapping to ISO 27001 Annex A is indicative and written by this project (it does not reuse the SCF mappings); this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the SCF Council."
msgstr "Domain identifiers and names: Secure Controls Framework (SCF), © SCF Council, licensed under CC BY-ND 4.0, reproduced without modification. The mapping to ISO 27001 Annex A is indicative and written by this project (it does not reuse the SCF mappings); this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the SCF Council."

